  "prompt": "After `git add foo`, `git diff foo` prints nothing, and thefuck suggests `git diff foo --staged`, which git rejects (`fatal: bad flag '--staged' used after filename`). The suggestion must put `--staged` right after `diff`: `git diff --staged foo`. A plain `git diff` must still become `git diff --staged`.\n\nTests: `python -m pytest -q tests` (the functional tests skip themselves without Docker).",
